  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Executive Leadership Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Executive Leadership Initiative (GELI) is being developed to challenge senior international field leaders to maximize their leadership excellence and lead more collaboratively, while simultaneously ensuring a larger number of senior field leaders respond to complex crises, contribute to wider system change, and improve performance that saves lives of crisis affected people.</narrative>
  </description>
